            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/705123?u=e5951458a5a0613e6511fef73a5b602954dc3580&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\"><a class=\"commit-link\" href=\"https://github.com/polkit-org/polkit/compare/124...126\">polkit-org/polkit@<tt>124...126</tt></a></p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Read actions also from /etc/, /run/ and /usr/local/share/ <a class=\"commit-link\" data-hovercard-type=\"commit\" data-hovercard-url=\"https://github.com/polkit-org/polkit/commit/9958c259f82b066f613d171d2934c1bd829e31a4/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/polkit-org/polkit/commit/9958c259f82b066f613d171d2934c1bd829e31a4\">polkit-org/polkit@<tt>9958c25</tt></a></li>\n<li>Same for rules <a class=\"commit-link\" data-hovercard-type=\"commit\" data-hovercard-url=\"https://github.com/polkit-org/polkit/commit/6c5705e0d36a8b893cf2d0f888d88b0c7c19edc9/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/polkit-org/polkit/commit/6c5705e0d36a8b893cf2d0f888d88b0c7c19edc9\">polkit-org/polkit@<tt>6c5705e</tt></a> <a class=\"commit-link\" data-hovercard-type=\"commit\" data-hovercard-url=\"https://github.com/polkit-org/polkit/commit/9345fd50b34827ba226cc7ff042624a7ed3abb6f/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/polkit-org/polkit/commit/9345fd50b34827ba226cc7ff042624a7ed3abb6f\">polkit-org/polkit@<tt>9345fd5</tt></a></li>\n<li>systemd-tmpfiles.d integration – <a href=\"https://github.com/polkit-org/polkit/pull/442#issuecomment-2692493869\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/polkit-org/polkit/pull/442/hovercard\">unnecessary</a>, we already have <code class=\"notranslate\">/etc</code> managed by NixOS.</li>\n<li>Drop mocklibc.</li>\n<li>The new test wrapper no longer requires us to run dbus session ourselves.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Things done</h2>\n\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" checked=\"\"> Skimmed <a